step Morrowgrain (optional)
  label morrowgrain
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Morrowgrain to Thunder Bluff takes 10 Morrowgrain for 50, as often as you like, and pays in full at 60, but it is slow: the Evergreen Pouch grows one casing every 10 minutes and a casing holds about one Morrowgrain on average, so each hand-in takes about 90 minutes of waiting, 18 Un'Goro Soil and 9 seed packets (90 silver). It runs beside whatever else you do: a little over 30 reputation an hour. The chain before it is level 50 (in Classic a fifth at 60). Innkeeper Pala sends you to Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise; he wants 20 Un'Goro Soil.
  accept 3762                         -- Innkeeper Pala: Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem
  turnin 3762                         -- Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem
  accept 3761                         -- Un'Goro Soil, +100

step Un'Goro Crater: Un'Goro Soil
  when done morrowgrain
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Nearly every beast, plant and silithid in the crater drops Un'Goro Soil, about one kill in three (the Bloodpetals and the Gorishi wasps about one in two), and the dirt mounds give it too. Take far more than 20: every casing uses 2, about 18 for each Morrowgrain hand-in.
  collect 11018 x20 quest 3761.1      -- Un'Goro Soil

step Thunder Bluff: Morrowgrain Research
  when done morrowgrain
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Ghede takes the soil. Bashana Runetotem sells the Evergreen Pouch (1 gold) and Packets of Tharlendris Seeds (10 silver each). With a seed packet and 2 Un'Goro Soil in your bags, use the pouch: it grows an Evergreen Herb Casing, once every 10 minutes. Open each casing: about one in three holds 1 to 5 Morrowgrain, the rest common herbs. Use the pouch whenever it is ready while you follow the rest of this guide.
  turnin 3761                         -- Ghede
  accept 3782                         -- Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem: Morrowgrain Research
  turnin 3782                         -- Bashana Runetotem
  accept 3786                         -- Morrowgrain Research, +100
  buy 11020 npc 9087                  -- Evergreen Pouch, 1 gold
  buy 11022 x10 npc 9087              -- Packet of Tharlendris Seeds, 10 silver each

step Morrowgrain as you go
  when done morrowgrain
  along until morrowgrain-in
  collect 11040 x10 quest 3786.1 @71.1,34.2 -- Morrowgrain: use the pouch every 10 minutes and open the casings; Bashana takes it

step Gloomrise (optional hub)
  label gloomrise
  zone Mulgore
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. The Earthen Ring camp on the Skywatcher Plateau, north-west of Thunder Bluff: 300 Thunder Bluff reputation in 20 minutes (60 at a fifth), plus 100 each for Orgrimmar and the Darkspear Trolls and 450 Earthen Ring. Muln Earthfury, Mazu'kon and Yorn Grimtotem stand in the camp.
  accept 96259                        -- Muln Earthfury: Defending the Dead, +100
  accept 96261                        -- The Broodmother
  accept 96241                        -- Mazu'kon: Talkin' bout Toxins, Mon (Darkspear +100)
  accept 96260                        -- Yorn Grimtotem: Stronger than Steel, +100

step Gloomrise
  when done gloomrise
  tip Gloomrise is the tauren burial ground north of Thunder Bluff. Use the Toxin Extractor on the Gnawed Corpses. Broodmother Valraxx waits at the heart of it; her body carries a Bloody Parchment: read it to start A Darker Truth.
  kill 264079 x10 quest 96259.2       -- Gloomrise Hatchling
  kill 264083 x5 quest 96259.1        -- Gloomrise Soldier
  collect 273181 x3 quest 96260.1     -- Crystalline Silk, from Gloomrise Spinners
  collect 273001 x5 quest 96241.1     -- Gloomrise Toxin Sample
  kill 264082 quest 96261.1           -- Broodmother Valraxx
  accept 96294 item 273658            -- Bloody Parchment: A Darker Truth, +100 (Orgrimmar +100)

