step Camp Narache (optional hub)
  label narache
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Camp Narache, at the south end of Mulgore: about 1,100 Thunder Bluff reputation in 25 minutes (220 at a fifth). Starting-zone quests give the other cities no share. Grull Hawkwind and Chief Hawkwind stand in the camp, Brave Windfeather at its edge.
  accept 747                          -- Grull Hawkwind: The Hunt Begins, +100
  accept 752                          -- Chief Hawkwind: A Humble Task, +50
  accept 3376                         -- Brave Windfeather: Break Sharptusk!, +200

