step Bloodhoof Village (optional hub)
  label bloodhoof
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Bloodhoof Village and eastern Mulgore: about 1,000 Thunder Bluff reputation in 45 minutes (200 at a fifth). Baine Bloodhoof stands in the middle of the village; Harken Windtotem, Ruul Eagletalon and Brave Wildrunner close by; Morin Cloudstalker waits east of the village by the road.
  accept 745                          -- Baine Bloodhoof: Sharing the Land, +100
