step Eastern Mulgore
  when done bloodhoof
  tip Longwalker Malah waits by the eastern border. The Sealed Supply Crate of the ravaged caravan lies north-east of the village: open it to start the next quest. The Venture Co. mine is further north-east; the elite shredder Venture Co. Clearcutter works deep inside.
  turnin 99079                        -- Longwalker Malah
  accept 99081                        -- Grim Tidings, +10
  turnin 749                          -- the Sealed Supply Crate
  accept 751                          -- The Ravaged Caravan, +75
