  when done bloodhoof
  tip Back to the mine for the workers, supervisors and Supervisor Fizsprocket. The Galak centaurs and Herak camp east of the village. Swoops fly all over Mulgore; the Windfury harpies roost south-east of the village; the Palemane gnolls camp west of it.
