step Rumstag Proudstrider: A Donation of Wool
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before Rumstag offers the Runecloth donation, and Additional Runecloth needs the Runecloth donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, Runecloth 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey.
  zone Ashenvale
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7820.1 @36,37      -- Wool Cloth: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four
  turnin 7820                         -- Rumstag Proudstrider, +150

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk: the Syndicate in Hillsbrad and Alterac drop it about one kill in three, or buy it.
  level 26
  accept 7821                         -- +150
  zone Alterac Mountains
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7821.1 @57.7,67.6 -- Silk Cloth: the Syndicate
  turnin 7821

step A Donation of Mageweave
