  zone Felwood
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7822.1 @41.6,85.7 -- Mageweave Cloth: the Jadefire satyrs
  turnin 7822

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth: the Scarlet at Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands, the Gordok ogres outside Dire Maul in Feralas and the Twilight camps of Silithus drop it about one kill in three. The Auction House is faster if you have gold.
  level 50
  accept 7823                         -- +150
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7823.1 live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7823

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Additional Runecloth: 20 Runecloth for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 Runecloth, less what the quests gave you (a tauren starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; an Undead at Neutral 500 first needs 50 more to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7825 direct optional         -- Rumstag Proudstrider: Additional Runecloth, +50
  zone Thunder Bluff
  collect 11040 x10 optional @71.1,34.2 -- Morrowgrain, if you grow it: Bashana takes it
  turnin 3804 direct optional         -- Bashana Runetotem: Morrowgrain to Thunder Bluff, +50
  rep 81 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 Runecloth, fewer if you also hand in Morrowgrain. Blackrock Depths pays too: Disharmony of Flame and Disharmony of Fire from Thunderheart at Kargath (Lord Incendius, 150 in full).
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7825 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  zone Thunder Bluff
  collect 11040 x10 optional @71.1,34.2 -- Morrowgrain, if you grow it
  turnin 3804 direct optional         -- Morrowgrain to Thunder Bluff, +50
  rep 81 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. For The Horde! (Rend's head) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city. At Exalted, Harb Clawhoof in Bloodhoof Village sells the kodos to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 kodo, 200 gold for a great kodo at level 60 (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7825 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  zone Thunder Bluff
  collect 11040 x10 optional @71.1,34.2 -- Morrowgrain, if you grow it
  turnin 3804 direct optional         -- Morrowgrain to Thunder Bluff, +50
  rep 81 Exalted
  talk 3685 optional                  -- Harb Clawhoof: the kodos
